{"video":"er5aJy0fHvI","lines":[{"t":[0,7.6],"en":"Happy birthday, Michael."},{"t":[7.7,8.6],"en":"Oh, what?"},{"t":[9,10.4],"en":"I said happy birthday."},{"t":[10.8,11.5],"en":"Thank you."},{"t":[11.9,12.9],"en":"That's really nice."},{"t":[13.2,17.7],"en":"Today is my B-Day, and people around here just go crazy for it."},{"t":[17.7,18.6],"en":"I don't know why."},{"t":[19,19.9],"en":"Oh, fun fact."},{"t":[20.3,22.1],"en":"I share my birthday with Eva Longoria."},{"t":[24,28.1],"en":"So I'm a perfect icebreaker if I ever meet Terry Hatcher."},{"t":[28.9,29.6],"en":"You excited?"},{"t":[30,30.4],"en":"Mm-hmm."},{"t":[30.7,31.7],"en":"Everybody freaking out?"},{"t":[31.9,32.2],"en":"Mm-hmm."},{"t":[32.4,32.8],"en":"Cool."},{"t":[33,33.9],"en":"It's going to be fun."},{"t":[34,34.7],"en":"You're late."},{"t":[34.9,35.3],"en":"Thank you."},{"t":[35.3,38.2],"en":"But I forgive you because Dothit is my birthday."},{"t":[40.2,40.9],"en":"What's up?"},{"t":[41.6,42],"en":"Hey."},{"t":[43.6,44.6],"en":"Oh, happy birthday."},{"t":[45.1,46.3],"en":"Ah, thank you, sir."},{"t":[47.8,48.7],"en":"Michael's birthday."},{"t":[49.6,51.3],"en":"It's pretty fun to watch, actually."},{"t":[51.7,54.4],"en":"He gets very excited, and then he eats a lot of cake."},{"t":[54.8,56.3],"en":"And then he runs around the office,"},{"t":[56.8,58.3],"en":"and then he has a sugar crash in the afternoon,"},{"t":[58.3,59.6],"en":"and then he falls asleep."},{"t":[59.8,62.1],"en":"And that's when we get our work done."},{"t":[64.2,64.6],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[64.6,64.9],"en":"Yes."},{"t":[65.5,67.2],"en":"There he is, the birthday boy."},{"t":[67.3,68],"en":"Oh, God."},{"t":[68,68.7],"en":"Birthday hug."},{"t":[68.9,69.5],"en":"No, no, no, no."},{"t":[69.6,70.8],"en":"New suit, please."},{"t":[70.9,72],"en":"That suit is amazing."},{"t":[72.2,73.4],"en":"Thank you very much."},{"t":[73.6,74.8],"en":"It is from Italy."},{"t":[75.1,77.4],"en":"Actually, no, Bulgaria."},{"t":[77.9,78.2],"en":"Mm."},{"t":[78.4,79.7],"en":"So maybe I should get one."},{"t":[80.1,80.6],"en":"Good luck."},{"t":[80.7,81.4],"en":"One of a kind."},{"t":[82.4,82.7],"en":"eBay."},{"t":[83.5,83.9],"en":"Question."},{"t":[84.3,87.1],"en":"May I be in charge of the party planning festivities?"},{"t":[87.1,87.9],"en":"Not necessary."},{"t":[88,89.8],"en":"The party planning committee is all over it."},{"t":[89.8,91.8],"en":"They've been working 24-7 all day yesterday."},{"t":[92.1,92.4],"en":"Excellent."},{"t":[92.6,94.8],"en":"On my part, I did manage to reserve the..."},{"t":[94.8,95.5],"en":"Oh, no."},{"t":[95.9,98.3],"en":"Please don't want to spoil it for anybody."},{"t":[98.7,99.5],"en":"Spoil the surprise."},{"t":[99.6,100.6],"en":"Let's get the party started."},{"t":[100.7,101.8],"en":"Let's get the party started."},{"t":[102,102.9],"en":"Not the way I taught you."},{"t":[109.3,109.8],"en":"Yeah?"},{"t":[110.3,111.8],"en":"Michael, I have Jan on the line."},{"t":[111.8,112.3],"en":"Oh, great."},{"t":[112.3,112.8],"en":"Put her through."},{"t":[114.7,115.3],"en":"Hello, Michael."},{"t":[115.6,116.1],"en":"Hey, you."},{"t":[117.6,118.7],"en":"I'm returning your call."},{"t":[118.8,119.5],"en":"You said it was urgent."},{"t":[119.8,120.3],"en":"It is urgent."},{"t":[120.3,122],"en":"I just wanted to call and wish you a happy birthday."},{"t":[122.5,124.6],"en":"Well, today's not my birthday, so..."},{"t":[124.6,125],"en":"Really?"},{"t":[125.9,127.9],"en":"Because I thought we had the same birthday."},{"t":[130.4,131.5],"en":"Happy birthday, Michael."},{"t":[131.6,131.9],"en":"Thanks."},{"t":[133.7,134.6],"en":"Am I on camera?"},{"t":[135.5,136.1],"en":"Nope."},{"t":[137.1,138],"en":"Totally private."},{"t":[139.1,140.9],"en":"You can say whatever is in your heart."},{"t":[146,147.3],"en":"You can take a five if you want."},{"t":[161.2,168.5],"en":"Somebody brought in donuts for my birthday."},{"t":[169.6,170.5],"en":"Happy birthday."},{"t":[170.7,171.1],"en":"Thanks."},{"t":[175.1,175.5],"en":"Hi."},{"t":[175.8,177.1],"en":"Delivery for Michael Scott."},{"t":[177.9,178.8],"en":"Here we go."},{"t":[180,180.5],"en":"Okay."},{"t":[180.7,181.4],"en":"This is great."},{"t":[182.5,183.6],"en":"Thank you, my friend."},{"t":[183.6,184.3],"en":"She is perfect."},{"t":[185.4,185.9],"en":"Dwight."},{"t":[185.9,186.9],"en":"Dwight, may I have your chair, please?"},{"t":[187.5,189.7],"en":"And some singles, if you will?"},{"t":[190.2,191.4],"en":"All right."},{"t":[193.6,193.9],"en":"Ding."},{"t":[194.8,195.3],"en":"Okay."},{"t":[197.4,198],"en":"All right."},{"t":[198.7,199.5],"en":"This has arms."},{"t":[199.5,200.6],"en":"Is that going to be a..."},{"t":[200.6,201],"en":"Is that all right?"},{"t":[202.5,203.1],"en":"Sure."},{"t":[203.1,203.2],"en":"Sure."},{"t":[203.2,207.7],"en":"I'm so nervous."},{"t":[209.9,211],"en":"I can sign for it."},{"t":[211.2,212.3],"en":"Oh, thanks."},{"t":[213.9,222.6],"en":"When I was seven, my mother hired a pony and a cart to come to my house for all the kids."},{"t":[223.9,228.7],"en":"And I got a really bad rash from the pony."},{"t":[229.5,231.2],"en":"And all the kids got to ride the pony."},{"t":[231.4,232.3],"en":"And I had to go inside."},{"t":[232.5,236.7],"en":"And my mother was rubbing cream on me for probably three hours."},{"t":[236.9,238.2],"en":"And I never came outside."},{"t":[238.7,241.9],"en":"And by the time I got out, the pony was already in the truck and around the corner."},{"t":[243.3,244.7],"en":"So that was my worst birthday."},{"t":[244.7,259.6],"en":"It's for the longest time by William Joel."},{"t":[259.8,260.8],"en":"It's our favorite song."},{"t":[261,262],"en":"Yeah, when I saw the radio."},{"t":[262.6,263.6],"en":"My birthday blows."},{"t":[265,266.6],"en":"Nobody even signed my birthday poster."},{"t":[267.8,271.6],"en":"Apparently, my mother is the only one who cares enough to send me anything."},{"t":[272,273.7],"en":"I probably care more than she does."},{"t":[273.7,274.7],"en":"You're making it worse."},{"t":[274.7,279.2],"en":"I bet Luke Perry's friends don't treat him like this."},{"t":[299.9,300.3],"en":"Okay."}]}
